# SQL files - all migrations and schemas handled locally
*.sql

# Worker SOURCE is TRACKED in git (policy 2026-08-03).
# Rationale: worker source lived only locally + gitignored, and a clean wiped it. Source in git =
# source that cannot be lost irreversibly. Secrets/build/config stay OUT via the global rules above:
#   .env · .dev.vars · node_modules · dist · .wrangler/ · *.toml (all wrangler.toml) · *.sql
# Do NOT re-add whole worker-dir ignores here.

